Plan Validation

In order to transport Fret, an amazon truck driver needs to know their schedule(Called a plan)

Between fulfilment centres and other transport hubs, example

At 1PM, pick up pallet 1 at location A

At 1PM, drop off pallet 1 at location B

At 2PM, pick up pallet 2 at location B

At 3PM, drop off pallet 1 and pallet 2 at location C

Question -

1. Design a data model to represent a plan

2. Before a plan can be communicated to a truck driver, we need to verify the plan is valid to execute.
Write an extensible program which checks if a given input plan is valid

3. What do you think some useful validations could be

Follow-ups

1. Scale plan validation(100s of validations)
2. How can client customize the validators they require
3. Modelling verbose output to Customer



// Event times are strictly increasing

// Every pallet picked up must be dropped off

// Pickup before drop off for a pallet




